     4840      WHEN "B2":U  Then DO :
     4841                DISPLAY stream  OutStream sym1 sym2 sym3 sym4 sym5 sym6 sym7 sym8 sym9 sym10 sym11 sym12
     4842                   p3 @ gds-zap-b-code
     4843                   p4 @ gds-zap-artic
     4844                   p5 @ gds-zap-gds-name
     4845                   p6 @ gds-zap-unit-base
